                        "form": "die Trugbilder"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f6893a6b-7290-332e-a863-12b344baa512",
                        "entry_id": "1f5ce297-962f-35a0-beb5-ee34c0f0026b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Bild/Vorstellung, die etwas nicht Vorhandenes darstellt"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a32a4245-9ee1-4205-8fe2-e4454914aec6",
                                "sense_id": "f6893a6b-7290-332e-a863-12b344baa512",
                                "text": "„Es war kein Trugbild.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "27e5f01e-bd49-4eed-8742-758eb2705b2a",
                                "sense_id": "f6893a6b-7290-332e-a863-12b344baa512",
                                "text": "„Schließlich konnten die Dämonen, die sich Pachecos bemächtigt hatten, ja auch seine Sinne verwirren und ihm allerlei Trugbilder vorgaukeln.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5532ebee-21d3-45e5-a73f-deb6c224fbe1",
                                "sense_id": "f6893a6b-7290-332e-a863-12b344baa512",
                                "text": "„Als sie hier stand, erschien ihr das andere Leben wie ein Trugbild.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d43f12ab-5702-4c4a-8076-2f9c5825f62d",
                                "sense_id": "f6893a6b-7290-332e-a863-12b344baa512",
                                "text": "„Jeder von uns sitzt solchen Zwängen und Trugbildern auf.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2af18885-0af3-460f-8cc6-6f8d24932c74",
                        "source_entry_id": "1f5ce297-962f-35a0-beb5-ee34c0f0026b",
                        "source_sense_id": "f6893a6b-7290-332e-a863-12b344baa512",
                        "source_sense_description": "Bild/Vorstellung, die etwas nicht Vorhandenes darstellt",
                        "target_lang_word": "delusion",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "delusion",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b65c5f67-0aad-3119-891c-416703c18f47",
                                        "entry_id": "01f2ba35-7b53-37a6-b287-bf57d0e04947",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A false belief that is resistant to confrontation with actual facts."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9b48afde-fd00-3bab-a31a-8ebc35a3c155",
                                        "entry_id": "01f2ba35-7b53-37a6-b287-bf57d0e04947",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being deluded or misled, or process of deluding somebody."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "abb910c6-d85e-452e-a554-79315d527f0b",
                                                "sense_id": "9b48afde-fd00-3bab-a31a-8ebc35a3c155",
                                                "text": "It is far better to grasp the universe as it really is than to persist in delusion, however satisfying and reassuring."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "948fe042-766f-3be2-93ea-09570c54c1db",
                                        "entry_id": "01f2ba35-7b53-37a6-b287-bf57d0e04947",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "That which is falsely or delusively believed or propagated; false belief; error in belief."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9dc44280-25f4-4eed-9fff-eb781113fa77",
                                                "sense_id": "948fe042-766f-3be2-93ea-09570c54c1db",
                                                "text": "Hess, always a muddled man though not so doltish as Rosenberg, flew on his own to Britain under the delusion that he could arrange a peace settlement."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ba01b9b7-0d6d-43e4-9140-a86db0b3ecfd",
                                                "sense_id": "948fe042-766f-3be2-93ea-09570c54c1db",
                                                "text": "“Project Greenlight,” however, bore down on the soft underbelly of the movie business, focusing on the delusions and colossal blunders of first-time directors, seemingly selected as much for their unlovability as their talent."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3d6f4064-0880-3ecd-b9f0-70cef3bffd97",
                                        "entry_id": "01f2ba35-7b53-37a6-b287-bf57d0e04947",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A fixed, false belief, that will not change, despite evidence to the contrary."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "040e5254-5046-4080-9fd8-82b96ea64cba",
                        "source_entry_id": "1f5ce297-962f-35a0-beb5-ee34c0f0026b",
                        "source_sense_id": "f6893a6b-7290-332e-a863-12b344baa512",
                        "source_sense_description": "Bild/Vorstellung, die etwas nicht Vorhandenes darstellt",
                        "target_lang_word": "faux-semblant",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "faux-semblant",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9c5bf1c8-b8cc-3556-84b3-ee06ab32aa23",
                                        "entry_id": "961791d1-f6d8-34c7-92f4-4f8a06f24084",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Affectation de sentiments qu’on n’éprouve pas."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dc74cb56-6ccb-4070-a9e9-ea0e81e30ddf",
                                                "sense_id": "9c5bf1c8-b8cc-3556-84b3-ee06ab32aa23",
                                                "text": "Je ne crois guère à son indignation : ce n’est qu’un faux-semblant."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "82563b43-cc4b-4d07-ad48-5c76eb14f6a1",
                                                "sense_id": "9c5bf1c8-b8cc-3556-84b3-ee06ab32aa23",
                                                "text": "Pourquoi cette débauche affreusement simple, dépouillée de tout ce qui, d’habitude, lui sert d’excuse, réduite à sa pure horreur, sans ombre de sentiment, sans le moindre faux-semblant de tendresse ?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "79a60a4a-e54b-45ae-880e-88757631271d",
                                                "sense_id": "9c5bf1c8-b8cc-3556-84b3-ee06ab32aa23",
                                                "text": "Mais comme le montre l’exemple nazi, le hurlement pseudo-médiéval non seulement ne remplace pas l’analyse rationnelle des causes des difficultés, mais en outre détourne les attentions et les énergies en direction de faux-semblants."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "919f18e1-3a31-331a-9584-cecffe70e974",
                                        "entry_id": "961791d1-f6d8-34c7-92f4-4f8a06f24084",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Apparence trompeuse."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "991ab9b9-e122-4355-a1b2-75c759979b5a",
                                                "sense_id": "919f18e1-3a31-331a-9584-cecffe70e974",
                                                "text": "La plupart des patronymes se répétaient et se ressemblaient, à croire que ces gens vivaient tous en cousinage. Mais ce n'était qu'un faux-semblant, le postier de Péronville l'avait bien avertie là-dessus. Elle l'entendait encore lui dire :« Ne te trompe surtout pas de destinataires, ma fille,quand tu liras tes enveloppes ! »"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "55d53375-4e47-418a-a2b5-ef5fab075ab6",
                                                "sense_id": "919f18e1-3a31-331a-9584-cecffe70e974",
                                                "text": "De nouveau il crachinait. Le printemps du dimanche n'avait été qu'un faux-semblant et l'aube du lundi avait ramené les nuages."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0f0d89b4-f447-49ba-965f-0c7f1ec3a6ed",
                        "source_entry_id": "1f5ce297-962f-35a0-beb5-ee34c0f0026b",
